WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:12.909
Poppy looked at the noisy building.

2
00:00:12.910 --> 00:00:16.344
"I'm not going in," she said.

3
00:00:16.345 --> 00:00:23.472
"The car wash is scary!"

4
00:00:23.473 --> 00:00:31.716
"It's not scary," said Mr. Grill.

5
00:00:31.717 --> 00:00:37.456
"It makes strange sounds," said Poppy.

6
00:00:37.457 --> 00:00:40.422
"Ha-ha!" said Zippy.

7
00:00:40.423 --> 00:00:44.261
"Poppy is afraid!"

8
00:00:44.262 --> 00:00:47.822
Poppy frowned.

9
00:00:47.823 --> 00:00:51.676
"The car wash is fun," said Jeb.

10
00:00:51.677 --> 00:00:55.758
"It has big brushes."

11
00:00:55.759 --> 00:01:03.791
"Brushes aren't fun," said Poppy.

12
00:01:03.792 --> 00:01:07.734
"It sprays you with water," said Dipper.

13
00:01:07.735 --> 00:01:10.882
"Hmm," said Poppy.

14
00:01:10.883 --> 00:01:25.252
"Water is kind of fun."

15
00:01:25.253 --> 00:01:28.721
"There are bubbles," said Eddy.

16
00:01:28.722 --> 00:01:31.516
Poppy's eyes got wide.

17
00:01:31.517 --> 00:01:36.032
"Bubbles?" she said.

18
00:01:36.033 --> 00:01:38.730
"I love bubbles!"

19
00:01:38.731 --> 00:01:41.844
Honk! Honk!

20
00:01:41.845 --> 00:01:45.628
Poppy raced into the car wash.

21
00:01:45.629 --> 00:01:48.913
"Woo-hoo!" she cried.

22
00:01:48.914 --> 00:01:59.004
"This is fun!"

23
00:01:59.005 --> 00:02:08.832
Everyone went back to school.

24
00:02:08.833 --> 00:02:12.775
"I love the car wash!" said Poppy.

25
00:02:12.776 --> 00:02:19.245
"That was the best field trip!"

